{"nodes": [{"id": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework_index_hvvp_viewport", "label": "HP/VP Viewport", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "#sim-viewport mounts the WebGL canvas and the CSS2D label overlay (HP/VP/quadrant callouts) plus the bottom-right first-angle badge; the whole subject is the HP/VP quadrant framework and first-angle fold."}, {"id": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework_index_quadrant_picker", "label": "Quadrant Picker Panel", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Step-2 'Move point P amongst Quadrants' panel: four data-quadrant I-IV buttons with a controller-stamped aria-pressed, each carrying a plain-words aria-label for its room definition."}, {"id": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework_index_fold_actions", "label": "Fold Actions Panel", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Step-4 reversible fold trigger (Fold HP down / Unfold back to 3D + done badge); a drag on the rotate-locked flat answer sheet fires a qv-lock-cue shake + focus ring on the Unfold button ('unfold to orbit')."}, {"id": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework_index_point_p_controls", "label": "Point P Controls", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "graphics_module_1_topic_2_spatial_framework/index.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A native Module-2 #controls group (Distance from HP / VP slider-plus-field pairs in mm), not a separate dock; re